CowSwapModule_Constructor
├── when cow settlement is zero address
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModule_ZeroCowSettlement
├── when owner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
├── when payment rails is zero address
│   └── it should revert with CowSwapModule_ZeroPaymentRails
└── when all parameters are valid
    ├── it should store cow settlement as immutable
    ├── it should cache cow domain separator from settlement contract
    ├── it should set owner
    └── it should store payment rails as immutable
